{"sourceUrl":"https://auto.hitwh.edu.cn/2026/0625/c189a215301/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:52.610534+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://auto.hitwh.edu.cn/2026/0625/c189a215301/page.htm","html":"<div><p><span><span>为</span></span><span>增进国内学子对哈尔滨工业大学（威海）汽车工程学院的了解</span><span><span>，展示学科发展特色，搭建优秀本科生学术交流平台</span></span><span>，</span><span><span>促进全国优秀学子交流互动，我院拟举办</span> 2026 <span>年</span></span><span>研究生学术交流营，诚邀优秀科研学子加入</span><span><span>。现将相关事宜通知如下：</span></span></p><p><span>一、申请资格</span></p><p><span>1.<span>拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为祖国建设服务，身心健康、诚实守信，学风端正。</span></span></p><p><span>2.<span>本次学术交流营主要招募能够在本科所在学校取得推荐免试研究生（简称推免生）资格的</span><span>2027</span><span>年优秀应届本科毕业生。</span></span></p><p><span>3.<span>外语水平优良。</span></span></p><p><span>4.</span><span><span>全国高校</span></span><span>车辆、交通、</span><span><span>机械、</span></span><span>船舶</span><span><span>、材料、能源</span></span><span>和电气</span><span><span>等</span></span><span>工科</span><span><span>专业的校内外</span>2027<span>年应届本科毕业生</span></span><span>，对车辆工程专业和交通工程专业具有浓厚兴趣，有志于从事相关领域的研究工作。</span></p><p><span>二、申请流程</span></p><p><span><span>1.</span><span>网上报名</span></span></p><p><span><span>即日起至</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>10</span><span>日，登录网址，填写报名，报名网址和</span></span><span><span>报名二维码</span></span><span>如下：</span><a href=\"https://www.wjx.top/vm/mRS6s69.aspx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>https://www.wjx.top/vm/mRS6s69.aspx</span></span></a></p><p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://auto.hitwh.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/81/24/91bb395841d39c862a3192b30806/56dbfa82-d3fa-4073-ad05-e1e0df8f0315.jpg\" title=\"\"/></p><p><span>2.<span>提交材料：</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）</span></span><span><span>所在院（系）或学校教务处盖章的成绩单（含专业排名）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>） </span></span><span><span>体现外语水平的证明材料（</span>CET4/CET6/TOEFL/GRE/IELTS<span>成绩等）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>3</span><span>）</span></span><span><span>获奖证书、发明专利证明等；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>4</span><span>）</span></span><span><span>其他证明材料。</span></span></p><p><span><span>请申请人将上述材料整合为一个压缩包，以</span><span>“</span><span>申请人姓名</span><span>-</span><span>学校名称</span><span>”</span><span>方式命名，上传至</span></span><span>报名系统</span><span><span>。</span></span><span>如果文件过大，无法上传，</span><a href=\"mailto:%E8%AF%B7%E6%8A%8A%E6%89%93%E5%8C%85%E5%90%8E%E7%9A%84%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%8F%91%E5%88%B0%E9%82%AE%E7%AE%B1416290004@qq.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>请把打包后的资料发到邮箱</span>416290004@qq.com</span></span></a><span>。</span></p><p><br/></p><p><span>3.<span>确定名单：</span></span></p><p><span><span>学院将根据报名者的申请材料，确定入选者名单，并将通过邮件方式</span></span><span>或短信方式</span><span><span>通知学术交流营入选者（届时未接到录取通知的同学皆为未入选者，不再另行通知）。</span></span></p><p><span>三、活动时间和安排</span></p><p><br/></p><p><a href=\"https://auto.hitwh.edu.cn/2026/0625/c189a215301/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span>学术交流营开营时间</span></span><span>为</span><span>2026 <span>年 </span><span>07 </span><span>月 </span><span>15 </span><span>日 </span><span>— 07 </span><span>月 </span><span>1</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>日（</span>2 <span>天 </span><span>1 </span><span>晚）</span></span><span>，活动安排如下：</span></p><p><span>第一日营员报到；</span></p><p><span>第二日上午：开营仪式、参观校史馆；</span></p><p><span>第二日下午：各科研团队参观、学术交流；</span></p><p><span>第三日上午：师生自由交流；</span></p><p><span>第三日下午：惜别离营。</span></p><p><span>四</span><span><span>、其他说明</span></span></p><p><span>1. </span><span><span>本次活动统一提供活动期间餐食、住宿，不收取任何报名费；</span></span></p><p><span>2. </span><span><span>入营后严格遵守学校安全管理规定；</span></span></p><p><span>3. </span><span><span>未尽事宜，另行通知。</span></span></p><p><span>五、联系方式</span></p><p><span><span>相关咨询：宋老师</span></span><span>0631-5687021</span></p><p><span>邮箱：</span><span>416290004@qq.com</span></p><p><span>哈尔滨工业大学（威海）汽车工程</span><span><span>学院</span></span></p><p><span>2026 <span>年 </span><span>06 </span><span>月 </span><span>26  </span><span>日</span></span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"25dda58e314925815154ba8a51559014b2ed0d35defaa9e278e8373476a1f88e","textLength":907,"sourceSha256":"c30b31b0404335ada8f81635d5455ccdee4ac4b6fd9570cf7c361899fd094237","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-797ea9c77019ca36f9e8","title":"2026年哈尔滨工业大学（威海）汽车工程学院2026年学术交流营活动通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:52.610534+00:00"}
